.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Represents a 32‑element MX‑block of \fBFloatUE4M3\fP values using \fBFloat8UMX<T>\fP as the underlying generic FP8 MX engine\&. 

This type provides a convenient strongly‑typed wrapper for \fBFloatUE4M3\fP MX blocks, allowing direct construction without specifying the generic parameter\&. 

.PP
The shared exponent controls the block‑wide scaling factor used during MX arithmetic (Add/Sub/Mul/Div)\&. All FP8 operations follow the unsigned E5M2 FP8 rules implemented in \fBFloatUE4M3\fP\&. 
.PP
